	(text_box "This schematic defines the electronics for a multi-sensor rover platform, including the LiPo power system, dual motor controllers, a multiplexed ultrasonic sensing array, wheel encoders, and an RC receiver for control input. A shared PING bus connects ten ultrasonic sensors through a routing and buffer stage, while the MSPM0 handles trigger generation, echo capture, motor control, and RC signal decoding."
